hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"688","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ziyad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Marwan Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Madina ka governor muqarrar karta tha. Jab bhi Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kisi aadmi ko apna tehband ghaset te ya apne paon zameen par marte dekhte to farmate: 'Muamla aa gaya' — phir woh farmate ke Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah us shakhs ki taraf (rahmat se) nahin dekhta jo takabbur se apna tehband ghaset ta hai.'"
"689","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ziyad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Marwan Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Madina par governor muqarrar karta tha, aur unhon ne pichli hadees ki manind bayan ki."
"690","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo takabbur se apna tehband ghaset ta hai, Allah us ki taraf (rahmat se) nahin dekhega.'"
"691","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Donon (joote) ikathe pahno ya donon ikathe utaro. Jab tum apne joote pahno to dayen se shuru karo; aur jab unhen utaro to baen se shuru karo.'"
"692","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli ki manind hadees riwayat ki gai hai."
"693","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi joote pahne to use chahiye ke dayen se shuru kare. Aur jab unhen utare to use chahiye ke baen se shuru kare. Use chahiye ke donon joote ikathe pahne ya donon paon nange rakhe.'"
"694","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: '(Bani Israil mein) ek aadmi tha jo joda pahne aur apne baalon mein latten banaye takabbur se chal raha tha jab use zameen mein dhansa diya gaya. Aur woh Qayamat ke din tak is mein dhans ta rahega.'"
"695","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli ki manind hadees riwayat ki gai hai."
"696","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ek aadmi chal raha tha.' Phir unhon ne pichli hadees jaisi zikr ki."
"697","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum se pahlon (Bani Israil) mein ek jawan tha jo kapdon ka joda pahne fakhr se takabbur se chal raha tha, ke zameen ne use nigal liya. Aur woh Qayamat ke din tak is mein dhans ta rahega.'"
"698","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne resham (pahanne) se sakhti se mana farmaya. Ek aadmi ne Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se kaha: Tum bhi resham pahne hue ho. Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Yeh resham nahin hai. Us aadmi ne kaha: Us ka taana resham ka hai. Abdullah bin Shaqeeq ne kaha: Main nahin janta tha."
"699","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sone ki anguthi (pahanne) se mana farmaya."
"700","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Godne wali ek aurat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas lai gai. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun: Kya tum mein se kisi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein kuch suna hai? To Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main khada hua aur kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Main ne Aap se (kuch) suna hai. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kya suna hai? Main ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Godna na karo, aur godwao nahin.' (Yani sui se jism par nishan bana kar un mein rang bharna.)"
"701","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha jab ek aurat Aap ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya do sone ke kanghan hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh aag ke do kanghan hain.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya do sone ki baliyan hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh aag ki do baliyan hain.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar aurat apne shauhar ke liye zeenat na kare to woh use napasand ho jayegi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhen chaandi ki baliyan bana kar unhen ambar (murakkab khushbu) ya za'fran se peela rangne se kis ne mana kiya hai taake woh sone jaisi ho jayen?'"
"702","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har woh qafila jis mein ghanti ho rahmat ke farishton ki suhbat se mahrum hai.'"
"703","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas taaza khajooron ka thaal lai, aur halki rom wali chhoti kakdiyan Aap ko tohfe mein di gayin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere hath mein sone ka zewar rakha aur farmaya: 'Use pahno.'"
"704","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Umm Aiman! Apni chadar ham se chhupao.'"
"705","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid Sakan (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aurat ko do sone ke kanghan pahne dekha, to us se farmaya: 'Kya tum pasand karti ho ke Allah tumhen aag ke do kanghan pahnae?' To us ne unhen phenk diya, aur us ke baad ham ne unhen us par phir nahin dekha."
"706","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aasteenen kalai tak thin."
"707","[AI-translation] Abu Salih ne Salman se wohi (hadees) riwayat ki."
"708","[AI-translation] Budail bin Maisarah Uqaili ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aasteenen kalaiyon tak thin."
"709","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo aurat apne gale mein sone ka haar pahnegi us ke usi jaisa aag ka haar pahnaya jayega, aur jo aurat apne kaan mein sone ki bali pahnegi us ke kaan mein usi jaisi aag ki bali pahnai jayegi Qayamat ke din.'"
"710","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton ke kapdon ke daaman ke bare mein farmaya: 'Ek balisht.' Main ne kaha: Phir un ki pindliyan khul jayengi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir ek hath (kafi hai).'"
"711","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah ki bahan (Fatimah bint Yaman Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: 'Aey auraton ki jama'at! Kya tumhen apni zeenat ke liye chaandi pahanne ki raghbat nahin hai? Kyunke jo aurat numaish ke liye sone ka zewar pahnegi use us ki wajah se azab diya jayega.'"
"712","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah ki bahan (Fatimah bint Yaman Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya; rawi ne pichli hadees ki manind zikr ki."
"713","[AI-translation] Abdullah ki biwi Zainab (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi isha ki namaz ke liye aae to woh khushbu na lagae.'"
"714","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jis ne apne baal mehndi se range the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh kitna achcha hai.' Phir Aap ek aur aadmi ke paas se guzre jis ne apne baal mehndi aur katam se range the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh us se behtar hai.' Phir Aap ek aur aadmi ke paas se guzre jis ne apne baal peele range the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh un sab se behtar hai.' Rawi ne kaha: Tawus (Rahimahullah) apne baal peele rangte the."
"715","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ki raan dekhi, to us se farmaya: 'Apni raan dhanko, kyunke aadmi ki raan us ke satr mein se hai.'"
